],{},[169,782,783],{},"Human approval"," — the MCP server does not invent a confirm protocol; the confirm gate lives in\nthe AI-client layer: the AI proposes, a human approves, the AI calls the mutation tool.",{"title":201,"searchDepth":21,"depth":21,"links":786},[787,788,789,790,791,792],{"id":190,"depth":21,"text":191},{"id":204,"depth":21,"text":205},{"id":228,"depth":21,"text":229},{"id":264,"depth":21,"text":265},{"id":362,"depth":21,"text":363},{"id":761,"depth":21,"text":762},"Product MCP — AI control plane over the admin API (list\u002Fget tasks & runs, trigger\u002Fpause\u002Fresume, delete)","md",null,{},true,{"title":129,"description":793},"LzdrNcjaWCR3dhBzxAAwL5FIWwUMeIM610Bpg_if5hQ",[801,804],{"title":121,"path":122,"stem":123,"description":802,"order":124,"badge":803,"children":-1},"Four ways to consume the sched admin UI — standalone, embedded at a path, components, or your own on the admin api",{"label":126,"color":127},{"title":133,"path":134,"stem":135,"description":805,"children":-1},"schedd (daemon) flags, env vars, config + sched (operator CLI) commands, exit codes",1794139017258]